   "text": "http : / / www . globalpost . com / dispatch / news / regions / asia - pacific / indonesia / 130702 / powerful - earthquake - injures - dozens - indonesias - ac July 2 , 2013 07 : 44 Powerful <3 earthquake> <4 injures> dozens in Indonesia's Aceh province At least 50 <24 reported> <5 injured> and buildings <6 destroyed> after a <7 6 . 1 magnitude earthquake> <8 strikes> Sumatra's Aceh province . A powerful <9 6 . 1 magnitude earthquake> <10 hit> Indonesia's northwestern Aceh province on the island of Sumatra early Tuesday . Dozens have been reported injured . The epicenter of the <11 quake> was roughly 55 kilometers from the town of Bireuen , a regency of the larger Aceh province , <25 according to> data from the US Geological Survey . <1 It> <2 took place> at 7 : 37 AM local time . Although it's unknown how many were injured , Sky News estimates\"at least 50 people , \" and numerous buildings have collapsed as an effect of the powerful tremor . The <12 quake> appears to have <14 shaken> the provincial capital of Banda Aceh , which is located at the northern tip of the Sumatran land mass . More from GlobalPost : Aceh's bloodstained elections \"I <23 see> many houses were <15 damaged> and their roofs <13 fell onto> some people , \" central Aceh district resident Bensu Elianita <26 told> the Associated Press . \"Many people were <16 injured> but it is <27 difficult> to <17 evacuate> them due to <18 traffic jams> . \" \"We have received around 50 people with injuries suffered when the walls of their houses collapsed , \" said doctor Ema Suryani to AFP , speaking from Lampahan city in Aceh's Bener Meriah district . Aceh was <19 hit> extremely hard by the massive <20 Boxing Day earthquake> and <21 tsunami> in 2004 , <22 killing> 170 , 000 people in Sumatra alone - with 35 , 000 bodies never <49 recovered> . The rebuilding process continues to this day from the enormous natural disaster . Here's a slideshow of images of the northern Sumatra quake on Tuesday .",
